message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "FORGE-Vision: A Hybrid Computer Vision and Generative AI System for Real-Time and Simulation-Based Employee Training"
authors:
  - family-names: Rezaul
    given-names: Karim Mohammed
    affiliation: Coventry University
license: Apache-2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24079047
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mashkur2016/forge-vision"
abstract: >-
  FORGE-Vision is a hybrid AI system for employee training that combines
  computer vision and generative AI to monitor workers performing tasks,
  detect deviations from Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), and deliver
  immediate, explainable corrective guidance. It is validated first on
  synthetic simulation data (Phase A) and then deployed with live camera
  feeds (Phase B). Developed as part of a DBA research project at
  Coventry University.
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - generative AI
  - employee training
  - standard operating procedures
  - pose estimation
  - explainable AI
